---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="EKAME 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shrink-0 w-20 h-20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/ekame.png`} alt="EKAME" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">EKAME 评测</h1>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">7.3</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/30">数据中心代理</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1">全球数据中心代理 · 专享独立IP · SOCKS5支持 · 匿名零日志</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">核心摘要</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">代理类型</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">数据中心 / SOCKS5</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">覆盖范围</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">全球 100+ 国家</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">核心特性</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">HTTP/SOCKS5 · 专享IP · 无日志 · Facebook/Google/TikTok</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">适用场景</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">广告验证 · 数据采集 · 社媒管理 · SEO跟踪</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">品牌与平台概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          EKAME 是一家提供数据中心代理和虚拟卡服务的综合平台。其代理业务覆盖全球 100+ 国家，提供专享独立 IP，支持 HTTP 和 SOCKS5 协议，适用于广告验证、数据采集、社媒管理和 SEO 跟踪等多种场景。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          除了代理服务，EKAME 还提供虚拟 Visa/Mastercard 即时开卡服务，支持 Apple Pay 和 Google Pay。代理服务采用账号密码认证方式，提供无日志匿名保障。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">支付与使用</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">IP + 端口 + 账号密码认证</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">虚拟卡 + 代理一站式</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">支持 Facebook/Google/TikTok</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">无日志基础设施</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">Telegram 机器人客服</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">平台特性</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">全球覆盖</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">数据中心代理覆盖全球 100+ 国家，支持多地区业务拓展和本地化需求。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">SOCKS5 支持</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持 HTTP 和 SOCKS5 两种协议，兼容各类自动化工具和浏览器配置。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">社媒友好</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">专门优化了对 Facebook、Google、TikTok 等主流社交平台的兼容性。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">一站式服务</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">同时提供虚拟卡开卡服务，方便用户在同一平台管理支付和代理需求。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>全球 100+ 国家覆盖</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>HTTP 和 SOCKS5 双协议</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无日志匿名保障</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>一站式代理 + 虚拟卡</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>仅提供数据中心代理</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>网站信息较为简洁</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>知名度相对较低</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          EKAME 是一家集代理和虚拟卡服务于一体的综合平台，数据中心代理覆盖全球 100+ 国家。HTTP 和 SOCKS5 双协议支持使其兼容性良好，无日志基础设施保障了用户隐私。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          虚拟卡服务的加持让它在同类产品中具有一定差异化优势，适合需要一站式管理代理和支付工具的用户。主要局限在于仅提供数据中心代理类型，网站信息较为简洁。综合评估，EKAME 获得 7.3 分评价。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://ekame.net/proxies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 EKAME
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
